//! The `isolation` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property determines
//! whether an element must create a new `stacking context`.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - auto: A new stacking context is created only if one of the properties applied to the element
//! requires it.
//! - isolate: A new stacking context must be created.
//!
//! Grammar: <isolation-mode>
